                            "inputSource":"craptech_aero_wing", "inputFactor":1, "inputCenter":0,
                            "inputInLimit":-1, "inputOutLimit":1, "inLimit":0.9125, "outLimit":1.3813,
                            "inRate":0.7, "outRate":0.7, "autoCenterRate":0.7}],
        //  Pop-up lift: four hydros per fin foot to the body (trunk rails, sides, floor and rear
        //  deck), chosen for the stiffest hold along the whole path. Each has its own input
